{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04350","headline":"蜀城怀古 · 刘希夷","name":"蜀城怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀土遶水竹，吴天积风霜。\n穷览通表里，气色何苍苍。\n旧国有年代，青楼思艳妆。\n古人无岁月，白骨冥丘荒。\n寂历弹琴地，幽流读书堂。\n玄龟埋卜室，彩凤灭词场。\n阵图一一在，栢树双双行。\n鬼神清汉庙，鸟雀参秦仓。\n叹世已多感，怀心益自伤。\n赖蒙灵丘境，时当明月光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}